  "title": "Apple Oatmeal Cookies",
  "description": "These soft oatmeal apple cookies with chunks of fresh apple and walnuts are perfectly seasoned with cinnamon and nutmeg for an awesome fall treat.",
  "authors": [
    "Laura S"
  ],
